Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Preserve boot files on persistence failures

---
 README.md                       |   3 +
 ndl/src/resources/install.c     |  11 +-
 ndl/src/resources/ndl.h         |   5 +-
 ndl/src/resources/persistency.c | 118 ++++++++---
